<https://caboodle.dev/stack/bobbin> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "just build" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/bobbin> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#gitDiscipline> "trunk-based, straight to main" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/bobbin> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#operationalNote> "use bobbin's own interfaces before ad-hoc search: MCP tools first, bobbin CLI second, HTTP GET /search?q=... as fallback (not a JSON POST)" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/bobbin> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#testCommand> "just test" .
