<https://caboodle.dev/stack/caboodle> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "just check" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/caboodle> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#installMethod> "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intigraph/tambo/main/scripts/install.sh | sh (prebuilt release binary, sha256-verified)" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/caboodle> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#operationalNote> "tambo install --plan caboodle-plan.toml applies a reviewed plan; tambo verify re-proves an installed stack" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/caboodle> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#verifyProof> "three proofs, not one: installed (version read-back), working (functional round-trip with a paired negative control), observable (Prometheus actually scrapes)" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/camayoc> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "just check" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/camayoc> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#gitDiscipline> "trunk-based, straight to main; quality gates are the only gate; never force-push main" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/camayoc> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#operationalNote> "RML executor: scripts/rml_executor.py validate|execute — governed mappings fetched from quipu, deterministic N-Quads, commits through the SHACL-governed /knot lane" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/camayoc> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#testCommand> "just test" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/camayoc> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#verifyProof> "gate probes must be able to FAIL: a probe that cannot distinguish a refusal from an unreachable store is not a gate (scripts/gate_probe.sh)" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/creel> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "just check" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/creel> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#gitDiscipline> "trunk-based, straight to main; work is not finished until git push succeeds" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/creel> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#operationalNote> "no dependencies, no build step; app/ is the deployable artifact; harness scripts share one global scope and their load order is semantics" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/creel> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#testCommand> "just test" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/creel> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#verifyProof> "tests/browser.js drives real headless Chromium over CDP" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/scbrown/quipu/blob/main/docs/design/spanner-capabilities.md> .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "just check" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#docsCommand> "just docs build" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#gitDiscipline> "trunk-based, straight to main; quality gates are the only gate; never force-push main" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#installMethod> "cargo install --locked --git https://github.com/scbrown/quipu --features shacl,onnx --bin quipu --bin quipu-server (no prebuilt release binaries; both bins named because quipu-server declares required-features and a plain build silently skips it)" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#knowledgeFlow> "structured sources -> camayoc RML executor -> quipu governed named graphs -> bobbin retrieval / quipu packs. Packs (.qpack.db) are ordinary quipu SQLite stores with a manifest: quipu unpack <pack> attaches one; quipu pack --verify <pack> proves integrity." .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#testCommand> "just test" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/quipu> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#verifyProof> "quipu accepts an episode via knot and a control-gated SPARQL query finds it; the negative control corrupts a byte and must go red" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/shantytown> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#buildCommand> "python -m pip install -e ." .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/shantytown> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#operationalNote> "zero runtime dependencies is a design constraint, not an accident; version constant lives in BOTH pyproject.toml and shantytown/__init__.py" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/shantytown> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#testCommand> "python3 -m pytest -q" .
<https://caboodle.dev/stack/shantytown> <https://caboodle.dev/ns#verifyProof> "a check must be able to fail: anything reporting health must be demonstrated returning red" .
